OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for raping teenage
OL,4,Agirls in the 1990s
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who raped and sexually abused
OL,7,Ffour teenage girls in the 1990s has
OL,8,Fbeen jailed.
OL,10,FDavid Campbell abused the girls between
OL,11,F1992 and 1997 while he was living at an
OL,12,Faddress in south Leicester.
OL,14,FThe 64-year-old, of Nuneaton, was found
OL,15,Fguilty of three counts of indecent
OL,16,Fassault and one count of attempted rape
OL,17,Fafter a trial at Leicester Crown Court
OL,18,F` all of which related to the same
OL,19,Fvictim.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
