OL,4,Agirls in the 1990s
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe had already pleaded guilty to two
OL,7,Fcounts of rape relating to a second
OL,8,Fvictim and two counts of indecent
OL,9,Fassault, which related to a third and
OL,10,Ffourth victim. He was jailed for 20
OL,11,Fyears on Thursday.
